{"error": false, "page": 2, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 2, "recordCount": 120, "data": [{"docid2": 1621284, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202101/t20210115_1621284.htm", "content": "    近年来，湖源乡坚持深入践行“绿水青山就是金山银山”理念，以党建引领为核心，以盘活资源为导向，以乡风文明为载体，走出了一条具有自身特色的振兴之路，一幅崭新的乡村振兴蓝图正在徐徐展开。\n　　一、激活“先", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202101/t20210115_1621284.htm", "docreltime": "2021.01.15 14:47:00", "doctitle": "沙县湖源乡：美丽蝶变，绘就乡村宜居新蓝图", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1716669, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202101/t20210115_1621284.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202101/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1607843, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/t20201225_1607843.htm", "content": "    一是强化大气监测网络。2020年在城区新建1座空气自动站，保证3座自动站定点全时段实时监测沙县空气质量，配合大气走航监测和4家机动车尾气监控系统，实现了“天地一体”全方位监测监管；二是提升水质监测网络。建", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/t20201225_1607843.htm", "docreltime": "2020.12.25 11:55:00", "doctitle": "沙县打造立体环境监管网络 描绘生态新蓝图", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1701131, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/t20201225_1607843.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1605142, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/t20201218_1605142.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，宁化县河龙乡林业站站长杨国群带领两名乡干部，前往下伊村巡山巡田，指导村民将稻秆进行无害化利用，制作有机肥。\n　　河龙乡地处闽赣边界，平均海拔597米，是全县平均海拔最高的乡。下伊村位于河龙乡南部", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/t20201218_1605142.htm", "docreltime": "2020.12.18 17:48:00", "doctitle": "宁化下伊村​：​发展生态农业 打好打赢脱贫攻坚战", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1698081, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/t20201218_1605142.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1599653, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/t20201207_1599653.htm", "content": "\n　　9月、10月，我市在全市范围内集中开展了两次“环保设施向公众开放”活动。11月27日，我市继续在全市范围内集中组织开放活动。又一批各界人士、群众代表走进重点排污企业、污水处理厂、空气自动监测站、垃圾填埋", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/t20201207_1599653.htm", "docreltime": "2020.12.07 09:53:00", "doctitle": "统一行动，集中开放——我市持续开展“环保设施向公众开放”活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1692006, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/t20201207_1599653.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202012/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1591411, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202011/t20201117_1591411.htm", "content": "\n　　    为让三明市区人民喝上安全、健康的饮用水，三元区中村乡以“行业清源”为目标，遵循“源头治理、标本兼治、协同配合、区域联动”的总体思路，在东牙溪水库饮用水水源保护工作中堵漏洞、补短板、强治理，给农", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202011/t20201117_1591411.htm", "docreltime": "2020.11.17 17:47:00", "doctitle": "为农药化肥做“减法” ，三元区织密市区饮用水源地“安全网”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1679371, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202011/t20201117_1591411.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202011/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1583156, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201029_1583156.htm", "content": "\n　　为保障群众的环境知情权、参与权和监督权，激发公众参与环境治理的积极性和主动性，三明市持续推进“环保设施对公众开放”活动，继上月27日组织全市开放活动后，10月27日，三明市生态环境局统一组织，在全市范围", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201029_1583156.htm", "docreltime": "2020.10.29 09:29:00", "doctitle": "环保设施向公众开放", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1670133, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201029_1583156.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1583117, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201029_1583117.htm", "content": "    在10月9日建宁、宁化两县入选第四批国家生态文明建设示范县榜单后，我市共有5个县荣获这项荣誉。 \n　　这份“十三五”期间的绿色“成绩单”背后，是我市深入贯彻落实习近平生态文明思想，推进生态文明建设，做实", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201029_1583117.htm", "docreltime": "2020.10.29 08:49:00", "doctitle": "三明市持续推进生态文明建设", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1670093, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201029_1583117.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1579936, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201019_1579936.htm", "content": "\n　　为做好配合2020年省生态环境保护例行督察工作，10月12日，市政府林俊德副市长主持召开督察工作部署会，市直有关部门负责人在主会场参加会议，各县（市、区）政府分管领导及有关人员以视频形式收听收看。 \n　　林", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201019_1579936.htm", "docreltime": "2020.10.19 11:01:00", "doctitle": "三明市召开配合2020年省生态环境保护例行督察工作部署会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1665975, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201019_1579936.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1577614, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201010_1577614.htm", "content": "\n　　1-9月，市区空气质量综合指数为2.77，空气质量达标天数比例为100%，全省第一(与南平并列);10个县(市)达标天数比例均为100%，空气质量综合指数范围为1.65-2.49。8个县进入全省58个县级城市空气质量综合排名前十，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201010_1577614.htm", "docreltime": "2020.10.10 16:04:00", "doctitle": "我市环境质量持续向好", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1663227, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/t20201010_1577614.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202010/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1570225, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202009/t20200916_1570225.htm", "content": "\n　　“门开了，心近了，感谢环保部门组织的这项活动，让我们有机会了解更多环境保护方面的知识，了解企业的环保设施和治理，触动我们深入去思考生活与环境的因果关系……美丽中国我是行动者，就从身边的点滴做起吧。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202009/t20200916_1570225.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.16 17:39:00", "doctitle": "环保设施向公众开放:走进金牛,心近了！", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1654872, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202009/t20200916_1570225.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202009/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1565809, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202009/t20200901_1565809.htm", "content": "\n　　为贯彻落实《水污染防治法》，统筹三明市“十四五”重点流域生态环境保护工作，我市于2020年8月26日在市生态环境局7楼会议室召开重点流域水生态环境保护“十四五”规划编制专题座谈会。市发改委、科技局、工信局", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202009/t20200901_1565809.htm", "docreltime": "2020.09.01 09:56:00", "doctitle": "我市召开重点流域生态环境保护“十四五”规划编制专题座谈会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1649977, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202009/t20200901_1565809.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202009/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1561591, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202008/t20200819_1561591.htm", "content": "\n　　2020年8月18日，我市率先在全省9个设区的地级市中完成排污许可发证登记任务。全市纳入此次核发登记范围的112个行业共涉及企业5524家，其中发证企业995家，登记管理企业4529家。为确保核发任务的顺利完成，我市采", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202008/t20200819_1561591.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.19 09:19:00", "doctitle": "我市提前完成排污许可发证登记任务", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1645220, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202008/t20200819_1561591.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202008/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1556789, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202008/t20200805_1556789.htm", "content": "\n　　7月30日下午,市生态环境局组织省驻市环境监测中心站、市自来水公司有关人员到东牙溪、薯沙溪水库水源地，调研察看水源地水质监测点位布设工作。\n　　东牙溪水库和薯沙溪水库是三明市区饮用水水源地，根据我市城", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202008/t20200805_1556789.htm", "docreltime": "2020.08.05 17:24:00", "doctitle": "市生态环境局现场调研市区饮用水源地水质监测点位布设情况", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1640000, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202008/t20200805_1556789.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202008/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1552157, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202007/t20200720_1552157.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，为推进全市土壤、地下水污染防治和农村生活污水治理工作，市生态环境局组织各县（市、区）派出机构召开工作推进会，总结上半年工作成效，部署下半年工作重点，谋划“十四五”开端。\n　　会上，市生态环境", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202007/t20200720_1552157.htm", "docreltime": "2020.07.20 17:02:00", "doctitle": "三明市生态环境局组织召开全市土壤、地下水污染防治和农村生活污水治理推进会", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1634873, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202007/t20200720_1552157.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202007/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1544046, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202006/t20200624_1544046.htm", "content": "\n　　根据生态环境部关于推进乡镇及以下集中式饮用水水源地生态环境保护工作指导意见的要求，为切实做好乡镇级水源地保护工作，我市积极推进乡镇级“千吨万人”水源地保护区划定工作。截止日前，我市已全面完成了10个", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202006/t20200624_1544046.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.24 17:16:00", "doctitle": "我市全面完成乡镇级“千吨万人”水源地保护区划定", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1625898, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202006/t20200624_1544046.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202006/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1538538, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202006/t20200605_1538538.htm", "content": "\n　　5月26日，省生态环境厅陈维辉二级巡视员带领生态环境部工程评估中心技术团队一行前来我市现场对接“三线一单”最新编制成果和上一轮征求意见采纳情况，并召开座谈会。市政府林俊德副市长出席会议并讲话，各县（", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202006/t20200605_1538538.htm", "docreltime": "2020.06.05 15:05:00", "doctitle": "我市召开“三线一单”现场对接工作会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1619696, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202006/t20200605_1538538.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202006/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1533005, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202005/t20200520_1533005.htm", "content": "\n　　一是“重管理”，防患未然讲深度。早排查、早发现信访隐患，以限期整改、关停取缔、提升改造治污设施等治理措施解决环境污染信访隐患，对不符合国家产业政策和环保准入的项目坚决不予审批，变投诉受理为源头治理", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202005/t20200520_1533005.htm", "docreltime": "2020.05.20 17:34:00", "doctitle": "三元区实现环保投诉办结和满意率双100", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1613378, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202005/t20200520_1533005.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202005/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1523948, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202004/t20200421_1523948.htm", "content": "\n　　一是实地踏勘，帮扶指导。局主要领导带领有关人员深入一线摸清企业实情，了解存在问题和困难，帮扶指导业主有序开展项目环评审批前期工作。二是多方协调，有力推动。局主要领导2次专程赴福州协调项目环评报告编", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202004/t20200421_1523948.htm", "docreltime": "2020.04.21 11:58:00", "doctitle": "市生态环境局优化环评服务助力复工复产", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1603301, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202004/t20200421_1523948.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1520741, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202004/t20200408_1520741.htm", "content": "\n　　3月27日上午,三明市2020年2月份环境质量会商工作会议在三明市生态云平台监控指挥中心召开，会议由市生态环境局张德乾副局长主持，参加会议的有福建省三明环境监测中心站、各环境要素管理科室、环境监察支队、市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202004/t20200408_1520741.htm", "docreltime": "2020.04.08 10:27:00", "doctitle": "市生态环境局召开2月份全市环境质量会商工作会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1599681, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202004/t20200408_1520741.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202004/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1467775, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "生态保护", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202001/t20200117_1467775.htm", "content": "\n　　2019年，我市主要流域国控断面水质Ⅲ类水比例100%，Ⅱ类以上水质比例为90%，位列全省第一。2019年第二季度和第三季度水质情况排名分别位列全国第24位和26位，为福建省唯一一个连续两季度进入国家地表水考核断面", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202001/t20200117_1467775.htm", "docreltime": "2020.01.17 17:25:00", "doctitle": "2019年我市主要流域国控断面水质位列全省第一", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1544472, "sourcename": "三明市生态环境局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202001/t20200117_1467775.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/hjbh/stbh18/202001/", "rels": []}]}